damaged_code:
```rust
lazy_static! {
    static ref GLOBAL_CONFIG: Mutex<Config> = Mutex::new(Config::default());
}
struct Connection;
impl Connection {
    fn new() -> Self {
        // Implicitly pulls in global state inside constructor
        let host = GLOBAL_CONFIG.lock().unwrap().host.clone();
        Self { host }
    }
}
```

fix:
Pass the required configuration struct directly into the constructor.
```rust
impl Connection {
    fn new(config: &Config) -> Self {
        Self { host: config.host.clone() }
    }
}
```
